{"id":"39adaf2272bb46e2","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-order10-cut-pair.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Cut Pair","display":"df-zfc-order10-cut-pair — ZFC Order10 Cut Pair","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-cut-pair","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-cut-pair"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-cut-pair — ZFC Order10 Cut Pair","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-cut-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-cut-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-cut-pair — ZFC Order10 Cut Pair"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,U,P,l,u\">\\(L,U,P,l,u\\)</span> (order parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span> (linear order on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (linear-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CutPair}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CutPair}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}cut\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CutPair}_S(L,U,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land L\\cup U=P\\land L\\cap U=\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall l\\in L\\,\\forall u\\in U\\;(l\\leq_P u\\land l\\ne u)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}cut\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CutPair}_S(L,U,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land L\\cup U=P\\land L\\cap U=\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall l\\in L\\,\\forall u\\in U\\;(l\\leq_P u\\land l\\ne u)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cut pair 的上下两部分必须相对于指定线性序分离；原式使用了未声明的全局严格序。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)$ (linear-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,U,P,l,u","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CutPair}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}cut\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CutPair}_S(L,U,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land L\\cup U=P\\land L\\cap U=\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall l\\in L\\,\\forall u\\in U\\;(l\\leq_P u\\land l\\ne u)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1007,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2858","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-order10-cut-pair.md|58-df-zfc-order10-cut-pair]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b40aa6d4a7d8288a"]}